  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">One Landscape: One Vision - Enabling all stakeholders to achieve sustainability for people, forest and wildlife in the Wologizi-Wonegizi-Ziama landscape</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This project contributes to: land use planning from village to landscape level with measures for critical conservation corridors and strengthening/bolstering forest areas (result 1), participatory protection, monitoring, management and governance of conservation areas (result 2) and for adjacent communities, natural resource management and sustainable benefits and livelihoods (result 3); while in parallel developing transboundary approaches and cooperation (result 4).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
